# Invoice Desk is a prebuilt, self-contained Flutter bundle. Each override is
# a decision (ADR-0006, ADR-0007, AGENTS.md rule 14), not noise.
# The bundle lives in /opt like the RPM, with a /usr/bin symlink.
invoice-desk: dir-or-file-in-opt *
# Flutter engine, AOT and plugin libraries are private, dlopen()ed files,
# shipped exactly as Flutter builds them (with their statically linked
# freetype/libjpeg/pdfium parts).
invoice-desk: embedded-library *
invoice-desk: shared-library-lacks-prerequisites *
invoice-desk: unstripped-binary-or-object *
invoice-desk: hardening-no-pie *
# Fonts are bundled only, so PDFs look the same on every machine.
invoice-desk: duplicate-font-file *
